            { "id": "c", "text": "나는 내일 책을 읽을 거야." }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "b",
          "explanation": "지금 (now) plus -고 있어 shows the reading is underway. 읽어 describes a habit (I read books), and 읽을 거야 is a plan for tomorrow.",
          "conceptIds": ["progressive-go-isseo", "present-casual"],
          "vocabularyIds": ["read", "book", "now"]
        }
      ]
    },
